{"id":"HAD-0282","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Umm Salamah رضي الله عنها berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"**Ja, wenn sie Flüssigkeit sieht.**","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Nr. 282","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī; authentische Sammlung."}